  role function but could not lift it: its binds and marks are not in effect,
  and it vouches for nothing. The file parsing clean is not evidence the
  function lifted; a companion diagnostic usually names the exact line that took
  it down.
        [ oracle.sh:2:1
     2 | hork__is_converged() {
       | \________________/
  3:13 warn [loop-brace-range:for-loop-brace-range-runs-once] [unwritten: for-loop-brace-range-runs-once]
  error[predict-out-of-dialect]: empty command
        [ oracle.sh:3:10
     3 |    for i in {1..10}; do
       |          \/

